actual_start_year = 1928
actual_end_year = 1928
edits_description = "The buildings and bridges were removed and the image was cropped."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_h6dpt")
blurb = "Depicts a bird's eye view of the Iori Valley pass in Etchū (present-day Toyama prefecture).

The river (which I believe is called Jinzu now) weaves through the valley, surrounded by high walls dotted with buildings, appearing as nothing more than points of light. Several bridge hang across the river.

The background features distant wooded mountains, against a hint of setting sun."
